  "headline": "Bournemouth stun Milan on landmark European night",
  "summary": "BBC Sport reports Bournemouth beat 10-man AC Milan 3-0 at Vitality Stadium in only the third European match in the club’s history. Justin Kluivert opened the scoring, Milan goalkeeper Mike Maignan was sent off after 27 minutes, and the Cherries added another famous result after earlier wins over Real Sociedad and Sturm Graz.",
